    "reviews": "\u201cFull Ace Tennis Simulator definitely deserves to be in the conversation for the best tennis game you can currently play by excelling in the most important metric of all: being quite fun to play. (...) on the court (it) brings to life all of the strategy and intuition that are required to succeed in tennis.\u201d<br>OperationSports (review of Feb 2021 updated version)<br><br>\u201cWith its on-the-go gameplay and perfectly controlled ball physics, Full Ace is able to offer us gaming sensations not found elsewhere.\u201d<br>8 / 10 \u2013 LightninGamer<br><br>8 / 10 \u2013 Gameblog<br>",
